stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Open : Step instantiated

    Open --> Assigned : Assign to staff
    Open --> Cancelled : Cancel step

    Assigned --> In_Progress : Staff starts step
    Assigned --> Cancelled : Cancel step

    In_Progress --> Resolved : Task finish
    In_Progress --> Cancelled : Cancel step

    Resolved --> Completed : Step verified

    Completed --> [*] : Finish step
    Cancelled --> [*] : Terminate